WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.143
Hi, I'm Dr. Afya.

00:00:02.143 --> 00:00:04.823
Here's how AfyaConnect works.

00:00:05.123 --> 00:00:06.595
We help you see a specialist,

00:00:06.595 --> 00:00:08.251
and keep your whole care journey

00:00:08.251 --> 00:00:08.926
in one place.

00:00:09.526 --> 00:00:09.905
One.

00:00:09.905 --> 00:00:13.033
Register with your phone number and ID.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:15.213
It takes about two minutes.

00:00:15.813 --> 00:00:16.119
Two.

00:00:16.119 --> 00:00:18.106
Choose a verified specialist,

00:00:18.106 --> 00:00:18.870
pick a time,

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.857
and send your booking request.

00:00:21.457 --> 00:00:21.892
Three.

00:00:21.892 --> 00:00:23.271
Your doctor confirms,

00:00:23.271 --> 00:00:24.795
and you both get the video

00:00:24.795 --> 00:00:27.044
link, with reminders by text message

00:00:27.044 --> 00:00:27.915
and in the app.

00:00:28.515 --> 00:00:28.857
Four.

00:00:28.857 --> 00:00:29.883
After your visit,

00:00:29.883 --> 00:00:32.072
the summary and your prescription are

00:00:32.072 --> 00:00:33.713
added to your health record.

00:00:34.014 --> 00:00:35.338
A doctor can open your file

00:00:35.338 --> 00:00:37.203
only after confirming your booking,

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.406
and you can turn that off

00:00:38.406 --> 00:00:39.008
at any time.

00:00:39.607 --> 00:00:39.961
Five.

00:00:39.961 --> 00:00:41.802
We keep reminding you until you

00:00:41.802 --> 00:00:43.714
choose the pharmacy you prefer.

00:00:44.314 --> 00:00:46.011
You will find everything in these

00:00:46.011 --> 00:00:47.405
tabs: Home, Appointments,

00:00:47.405 --> 00:00:49.163
Health record, and your care plan.

00:00:49.763 --> 00:00:50.449
Ready?

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:52.851
Tap Create your account.

00:00:52.851 --> 00:00:54.338
See you inside!

